-                        <h2 class="section-title">Why We Love League Music</h2>
-                    </div>
-                    <div class="content-text">
-                        <p>
-                            League of Legends didn't just create a game — they created a musical universe. 
-                            Over the past decade, Riot Games has partnered with world-class artists, 
-                            composed stunning orchestral scores, and produced music videos that rival 
-                            anything in the mainstream music industry.
-                        </p>
-                        <p>
-                            <strong>The Impact:</strong> These aren't just video game songs. K/DA - POP/STARS 
-                            has over 600 million views and spawned real-world concerts. Warriors introduced 
-                            millions to League through mainstream radio play. Pentakill released actual albums 
-                            that charted on Billboard. Awaken showcased animation quality that set new standards 
-                            for the industry.
-                        </p>
-                        <p>
-                            <strong>The Evolution:</strong> From early champion login themes to full-fledged 
-                            music videos with narrative arcs, League's music has evolved alongside the game. 
-                            Each year brings new innovations — virtual bands, animated cinematics, live 
-                            orchestral performances, and collaborations with top-tier artists.
-                        </p>
-                        <p>
-                            <strong>The Community:</strong> League's music transcends the game. Fans who've 
-                            never played League discovered it through music videos. Players bond over favorite 
-                            songs. Worlds anthems become yearly traditions. This music has become part of 
-                            gaming culture itself.
-                        </p>
-                        <p>
-                            We created this tournament to celebrate all of that — and to give the community 
-                            a fun way to engage with this incredible musical legacy.
-                        </p>
-                    </div>
-                </div>
