+                <li><strong>Public counts.</strong> Vote totals for every match are shown on the bracket, so anyone can check them.</li>
+                <li><strong>The draw is by numbers.</strong> Seeding comes from views and likes, then the groups are drawn automatically.</li>
+                <li><strong>Honest limit.</strong> No public vote can stop every determined attempt to game it. If you see something that looks wrong, <a data-contact-mail data-show-address href="/about#contact">tell us</a>.</li>
